# The build context is everything `COPY . .` can see. Keep it to what the build needs: smaller and faster
# to send, better layer caching, and no secrets or local artifacts in the image.

# Rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage

# Secrets: never in an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed to build
.git
.github
.claude
docs
**/*.md
**/*.log
.vscode
.idea
